  "description": "SemanticChunker.NET delivers automatic Semantic Chunking for Retrieval-Augmented Generation in .NET. The library splits long documents into embedding-aware, context-preserving chunks that fit your LLM’s token budget. Compatible with Microsoft.Extensions.AI and Semantic Kernel, featuring four breakpoint strategies, target-chunk mode, multilingual sentence detection and token-limit safety.",
